x11: implement window hide (minimize)

XWindowInner::hide() was a no-op, so the integrated title bar Hide
button and the Hide action did nothing on X11.

Send WM_CHANGE_STATE(IconicState) to the root window, as ICCCM 4.1.4
specifies and XIconifyWindow does.

Tested on muffin (Cinnamon).

